 826:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** /*
 827:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** ***************************************************************************************************
 828:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                                       RESUME A SUSPENDED TASK
 829:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
 830:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** * Description: This function is called to resume a previously suspended task.  This is the only cal
