1241:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                              SET THE CURRENT VALUE OF A TASK VARIABLE
1242:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1243:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** * Description: This function is called to change the current value of a task register.  Task regist
1244:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *              are application specific and can be used to store task specific values such as 'erro
1245:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *              numbers' (i.e. errno), statistics, etc.  Each task register can hold a 32-bit value.
1246:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1247:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** * Arguments  : prio      is the priority of the task you want to set the task register for.  If you
1248:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                        specify OS_PRIO_SELF then the task register of the current task will be ob
1249:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1250:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *              id        is the 'id' of the desired task register.  Note that the 'id' must be less
1251:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                        than OS_TASK_REG_TBL_SIZE
1252:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1253:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *              value     is the desired value for the task register.
1254:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1255:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *              perr      is a pointer to a variable that will hold an error code related to this ca
1256:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1257:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                        OS_ERR_NONE            if the call was successful
1258:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                        OS_ERR_PRIO_INVALID    if you specified an invalid priority
1259:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *                        OS_ERR_ID_INVALID      if the 'id' is not between 0 and OS_TASK_REG_TBL_SI
1260:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1261:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** * Returns    : The current value of the task's variable or 0 if an error is detected.
1262:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** *
1263:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** * Note(s)    : The maximum number of task variables is 254
1264:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** ***************************************************************************************************
1265:./ucos/Core/os_task.c **** */
